        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be among the stick beach volleyball champions! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The DELUXE Windows version features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Improved graphics using the HDRP rendering pipleine and HDR display outuput support</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Controller support</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More varied locations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Improved game code</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a stickman volleyball player! Time for some running and smashing of the ball on a beautiful 3d beach to relax.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >★ 3D levels and stick men</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >★ Quick match and tournament mode</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >★ Select your difficulty, and points per game ( 5, 15 or the full 25)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >★ quick volleyball match: single match, best out of 2 and best out of 5</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >★ no confusing things like career options, leveling or multiplayer </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
